  "description": "A Celebration of Grassroots Football Yes, the Grassroots Cup is back. Kicking off on Sunday, July 13 Event starts: 4:00PM Kickoff: 6:00PM Cohoes High School, 1 Tiger Cir,…",
  "bodyHtml": "<figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/bfd5bc33-0001-4aa3-8ac9-e90e9119c9d0/6-15-grassroots-615.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/ba3fdbde-d439-4142-8465-4db188f6bc87/grassrootscup-2-white.png?format=original\" alt=\"2023 Grassroots Cup logo with a green stylized tree icon.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">A Celebration of <span>Grassroots Football</span></h2></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><strong>Yes, the Grassroots Cup is back. </strong>Kicking off on Sunday, July 13</span></h4><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Event starts: <strong>4:00PM</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Kickoff: <strong>6:00PM</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"https://g.co/kgs/gDLmfnT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cohoes High School, 1 Tiger Cir, Cohoes, NY 12047</strong></a></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong>PRESENTED BY</strong></p></div><figure><a href=\"https://brookfieldrenewableus.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/d5d8f0ec-e5da-444a-8886-16566465354e/New+Logo+Print.png?format=original\" alt=\"Text logo that reads &#x27;Brookfield Renewable N.A.&#x27; in dark blue font on a white background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/68aa345c-ed6b-4c2b-b289-50e4d8eb7dc7/grassrootscup-gradient.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/054b591d-2f5d-44c5-ad94-438d18c206fa/6-15-grassroots-663.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"Soccer team standing in a line on a grassy field in the late afternoon, clapping and celebrating, with spectators watching in the background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">What is the Cup?</h2></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/13048eeb-ee5b-4011-9d2b-d04cdedd5dbc/6-15-grassroots-497.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"A group of soccer players and a young child walking onto a soccer field, with blue sky and clouds above, and colorful smoke in the background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong>The</strong> <strong>Grassroots</strong> <strong>Cup</strong> is a friendly soccer match hosted by <strong>Spindles</strong> <strong>United</strong> <strong>FC</strong>, based in <strong>Cohoes</strong>, <strong>NY</strong>.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Surrounding an exciting match between two local clubs, is an eventful evening of music, food, games, and celebrations of grassroots football.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">After a successful inaugural cup in the summer of 2024, Spindles is looking to exceed expectations and put on an even greater show.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Built for the local community, the Grassroots Cup is showing the <strong>Capital</strong> <strong>Region</strong> what <strong>amateur</strong> <strong>soccer</strong> should look like.</p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/68aa345c-ed6b-4c2b-b289-50e4d8eb7dc7/grassrootscup-gradient.png?format=original\" alt=\"Green gradient background fading from light lime green on the left to dark forest green on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Sun. July 13, 2025 | 6PM</span></p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/09f153cd-c7c3-4080-8090-47c6d797ebe1/grassrootscup-2-white2.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo for the 2025 Grassroots Cup featuring a stylized plant or tree symbol with the words &quot;2025 Grassroots Cup&quot;.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>vs</span></p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/b3943f9b-6df6-4d44-9af8-6514fed6a0ab/Full-logo-new.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo of the Women’s Super League Football Club featuring a red silhouette of a woman with styled hair, earrings, and a white background, encircled by red and green text that reads &#x27;SPIDENDLES UNITED FOOTBALL CLUB&#x27;, with the year 2022 split on either side of the woman&#x27;s head.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><a href=\"https://beestera.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/b55c1350-1061-449c-9ae4-3523b822fbe3/Beestera-primary-mark.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo of Beesterra Soccer, featuring a black and white circular design with a black cross, a star, a hexagon, and various geometric shapes, with the name and year 2015 in yellow around the edge.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Cohoes High School</span></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong>FOOD OPTIONS</strong></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><em>WHAT TO</em> <span>EAT</span></h2></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/8c2fa633-7f2c-4a3d-b509-37e3c49c38b5/moonstruck.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo for Moonstruck Mobile Kitchen with a stylized crescent moon in yellow on the right side.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/67284c1e-87e9-4cd6-8088-e7db11e2d11d/MK-black.png?format=original\" alt=\"A logo with a chef&#x27;s hat and the text &#x27;Saucy &amp; Sweet&#x27; with a custom font, and the word &#x27;sweet&#x27; styled with a chocolate and caramel texture. Below, a tagline reads &#x27;Savor da Flavor&#x27; with a fork illustration.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/466b2cdb-83d5-493a-a4e3-28757e5e60eb/aki-new.png?format=original\" alt=\"Cute panda holding a cup of bubble tea, with the text &#x27;Aki&#x27; in large black letters.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong>VENDORS</strong></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><em>THE</em> <span>VENDORS</span></h2></div><figure><a href=\"https://definedmassagetherapy.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/c6088fec-c261-4cea-86db-f43b8595e89f/defined-black-blue.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo for Defined Massage Therapy featuring a stylized human figure with extended arms, outlined in black with blue circles and lines indicating massage points, and a blue arc above representing holistic care.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"https://www.paintcohoes.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/7c2365f0-9a1d-49f5-b90e-1b6834f623f8/cohoes-paintpng.png?format=original\" alt=\"Silhouette of a USB flash drive\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/7ee8021e-1ca7-4f08-8a83-6ca289a6fdfb/6-20+CHS-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Cohoes High School</span></h2></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Keeping the Grassroots Cup at home in Cohoes, NY</span></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Volunteers Needed!</h2></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/5fdad4d9-15dd-45db-a113-3eaeb9e075f5/6-15-grassroots-447.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"Two young women in red shirts smiling and hugging in front of a red and white &#x27;WENDLES UN FOOTBALL&#x27; flag on a grassy field with a soccer goal in the background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The Grassroots Cup is nothing without the help of our local community.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">We are calling anyone looking to volunteer to help on the day!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Simple jobs, with a big impact. (Plus a free t-shirt)</p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/daaeaf8d-cadc-483d-9791-694a5dcde1e6/Untitled-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><a href=\"https://www.beestera.com/foundation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/71b28395-153d-4085-b4ac-68f45271dce5/wordmark-black-beefoun.png?format=original\" alt=\"Logo of the Beekeeper Foundation, with the words &#x27;BEEKEEPER FOUNDATION&#x27; in bold black letters on a transparent background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><span>100%</span></span><span> of our 50/50 Raffle Proceeds will be donated to the </span><a href=\"https://www.beestera.com/foundation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Beestera Foundation</span></a></h3></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/7ffc7025-0f79-4169-b881-ee0605d6ef96/grassroots+cup+print.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"Promotional poster for the 2025 Grassroots Cup soccer event featuring Spindles United FC and Beestera, scheduled for Sunday, July 13, 2025, at Cohoes High School in Cohoes, NY. The poster shows five excited people in red soccer jerseys and includes event details, sponsors, and activities like raffles, food, music, games, vendors, and football.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">See you there!</h2></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong>The 2025 Grassroots Cup</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong>Spindles United FC vs. Beestera (Friendly)</strong></p><ul><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sunday, July 13, 2025</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Event starts: <strong>4:00PM</strong></p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Kickoff: <strong>6:00PM</strong></p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong>Cohoes High School</strong></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">2024 Grassroots Cup</h2></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">A first of its kind event held at Lansing Park in Cohoes.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">More than 350 spectators attended a 5-3 thrilling win for Spindles.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Read the full event recap below.</p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/80a2fbe4-652d-49b6-b6ed-b372176c5eae/6-15-grassroots-595.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/3acdd107-cc3c-4118-b6bb-6b6101de4e98/6-15-grassroots-407.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/10aa8c55-daf1-449a-b63d-0cfc69808398/6-15-grassroots-489_edited.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/f892751d-5081-4731-a40b-68ee038c8b1a/6-15-grassroots-496.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/f6ff6761-5383-4548-bb28-8979ae7293cf/6-15-grassroots-454.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/89fb263b-df82-4007-8b58-c0e7e2cffb86/6-15-grassroots-424.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/0961395b-c58f-4c4c-b2e7-4f4fc24b9181/6-15-grassroots-566_edited.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/629d19af-8ef2-485c-a89d-28633c7bb02b/6-15-grassroots-498_edited.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/4f21294c-7c37-4cb8-863e-4d927b98bb98/6-15-grassroots-605.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/7c747dc7-fd1a-42f3-ae11-355173870034/6-15-grassroots-481.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/011b9818-e1e1-4183-94bc-7fe0062b3638/6-15-grassroots-663_edited.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"https://image